-10-26T12:27:19Z","value":176,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4456160","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1847286114030183","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"Performance Improvement Patch","summary":"You may have run into performance issues in our latest Demo update, and we're really sorry if that spoiled your experience!The good news: this patch should fix them and significantly improve performance.We wish you fast frames and strong defenses! 🔥⚔️0.19.4d – Patch Notes- Performance improvements- Fixed the display of bold Asian fonts- Small UI and UX improvements","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T20:04:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030183","verified_at":"2026-10-21T21:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1847286114029664","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"How Meta-progression Fixed our Game's Biggest Problem","summary":"Randomness in games is great, right? Well, not exactly.The GoodBy randomising different elements of our game, we greatly increased replay value, as each run is different, and the player has to adapt to whatever the game throws at them. They are unable to use their same winning strategy over and over again and instead have to come up with ideas on the fly. Moreover, they encounter new and different enemies, upgrades and map layouts each time, creating an exciting sense of discovery.The BadBut ran","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:02:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029664","verified_at":"2026-10-21T21:43:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1846651706696527","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch the Dev beat the new Demo!","summary":"Watch the Dev play through the new Steam Next Fest Demo and try it out yourself!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T19:24:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696527","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:22:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1846651706691287","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update: Forgotten Powers | Release Date Announcement","summary":"Next Fest is here, and we’ve come prepared with our Biggest Update yet, which we’ve been cooking up for quite a while. But that’s not all, Dawn of Defense will be launching on Steam on November 17th! Also, during Next Fest (October 19th - October 26th) you can participate in a Screenshot Competition in our discord server, where you can win a key for the full game! Here’s all you need to know about the new update: Meta-Progression After every run, you’ll earn some brand new meta-progression curre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:59:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691287","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1846651706680850","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Demo Preview","summary":"Hello again! Last week, we released the largest update to the Dawn of Defense demo to date for playtesting. Thank you so much for all of you who already checked it out and gave feedback on our Discord. Since playtesting went really well, we decided it’s time: We’d now like to give all of you direct access to all the playtested changes and loads more improvements since by setting build 0.19.2 live for the public. New Demo HighlightsFor everyone who hasn’t seen it yet, here are the highlights of l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:08:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706680850","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1846018067933724","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"You can test out our Next Fest Update Now!","summary":"Good news everyone!We have one of the largest and most exciting updates to date for the Steam Next Fest on October 19th, and we’re thrilled you guys can finally try it out! This is a particularly large update we’ve been working on for quite a while, so the game has changed quite a bit. If you want to test the version out before Next Fest, you can join our discord server where you’ll find all the info you need to play it: https://discord.gg/4yysrfB3xeHere’s everything that’s new:Meta-ProgressionA","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T15:25:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933724","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1845383656395855","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"AI Improvement Patch","summary":"Attention Tribe-members!We have another patch ready for you which brings some handy new features, balance changes and fixes! Here’s what you can expect:AI ReworkYour opponents have a few new military strategies up their sleeve… The reinforcement system has been improved and enemies now allocate units to offense or defense more efficiently. But don’t worry, because friendly units are better too. They will no longer get aggroed towards unreachable units or stand around near a fight without giving ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T09:54:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395855","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1845383656392798","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"How we Designed the Eyodin Tower","summary":"Hey everyone! We're trying something by making some devlog posts showing you the process of how we make new features in our games. Let us know what you think!For a long time, our game only had three towers: the Boltskot, the Skullbrakkr, and the Tarbarl. Although they complemented each other well, we felt it was time to add another layer of depth to the way they interacted.We wanted a tower that could function as a support, one that would synergize with the towers already in the game rather than","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T08:08:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392798","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1840944183786030","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"Balancing Update","summary":"Greetings! Following the release of our latest major update Harvest & Mine, we bring you a patch with some new features, balance changes and fixes!🌲 A More Balanced WorldScouring the lands for resources to no avail? We've got your back! Stone and Iron deposits are more common while Forests are now slightly less abundant, opening up additional strategic options in the early game.🏗️ Economy ImprovementsResource buildings now benefit more consistently from global production buffs. These bonuses now","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T13:13:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786030","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1838407329265834","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update: Harvest & Mine","summary":"Here is what awaits you in this Massive Update!New Resource SystemWe've completely reworked the game economy and replaced gold with 4 new resources: Wood, Food, Iron, and Stone. Find forests and ore deposits on the islands, then build Sawmills, Quarries, Mines, and Windmills to build up your economy! New Tower: EyodinAn idol to the Allfather. This new tower marks enemies with a cold stare, making them much more vulnerable to your attacks. New Damage SystemAdding more depth to the combat! Units d","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T15:38:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329265834","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1835871199301003","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"0.17.3b - Balancing Update","summary":"Greetings to our Tribe!We know it's been a bit quiet for some time, and we apologize to everyone who was waiting for news, but we can only tell you that our team has been cooking up the upcoming and feature rich Harvest & Mine Update and we have a bunch of cool new features in the making we will share with you throughout the upcoming weeks. In the meantime we wanted to push out this balancing patch that takes care of a bunch of annoying bugs, overhauls the balancing and adds 2 new tower upgrades","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-17T15:05:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199301003","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1830163047258300","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"Major Demo Update: New Heights","summary":"Today we are announcing our first Major Demo Update: New Heights As the first of 4 planned major updates to our demo, this one introduces terrain height & island size as new strategical elements:Place your towers on elevations to buff their range and other stats.Islands have building capacities! Expand to new islands or pick the right runestones to increase the number of build plots you can fill with buildings and towers.Discover new status effects through tower upgrades, like flaming bolts that","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T18:49:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047258300","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1826992588590813","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"Graphics Settings Update","summary":"We listened to your feedback and made a speedy graphics settings update our top priority!This should hopefully save your PCs from burning up and your graphics cards from starting the jet engines. We also included hero respawn timer UI as well as new sounds for hero death and respawn to have you not miss Hogvald's revival again!Full Patch Notes Version 0.16.0New Features:Add Graphics Settings to the game:Settings for Vsync, framerate limit, full screen mode & upscalingSettings for graphics qualit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-11T18:36:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588590813","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1826362059930891","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Dawn of Defense Demo OUT NOW!","summary":"We're really excited to finally, finally announce the release of the Dawn of Defense Steam Demo today! We've been working towards this for a while now, and can't wait for you to try out all the new features. Here's a short feature trailer for a neat overview of what's new, check it out: FeaturesTower Defense × RTS × Roguelite: Command your tribe’s last defense against the Imperium AeternumDefend and Strike Back: Hold the line against waves of enemies, then launch RTS sieges to reclaim lost lands","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-09T17:09:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059930891","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1823191198605734","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Is Live! - EDIT: It's Over Now, Demo Soon!","summary":"Exciting news - our first playtest is live until Sunday the 22th! This is a chance for you to try out new features before everyone else. Please note: this is a very EARLY look. Things are not polished yet and will be improved as we go. Get Early Access to the PlaytestWith so many people signing up (thank you so much!), we’ll be giving access to the playtest in waves. If you want to be part of the first wave of playtesters, join our Discord: https://discord.gg/fJQawNCyyr We’ll have a Discord bot ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-30T16:06:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823191198605734","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1809235871617389","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for coming by at Gamescom!","summary":"We just wanted to say a quick thanks to everyone who came by our booth at Gamescom! It was lovely meeting many of you in person and check out the new version of Dawn of Defense.For those who weren't there, we'll announce a date for our playtest and demo soon 👀! You can already sign up for it on our Steam page. Tower Defense Games of our FriendsWe also met some other lovely indie devs at Gamescom, who are also working on Tower Defense games. If you like our game, there is a good chance you might ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-29T11:35:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1809235871617389","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-1800991756479911","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Developer Livestream","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-03T17:31:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1800991756479911","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-6212245217911824119","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Nominated for Ubisoft Newcomer Award 2024","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45023431/76f584de0b97e06b963222d594d6a5aa8b1c3797.png Dawn of Defense is one of the three Nominees for this year's Ubisoft Newcomer Award! We are very excited about the nomination and looking forward to attend the \"Deutscher Entwickler Preis\" event on the 3rd of December. Thanks to everybody who played our demo, gave feedback, or wishlisted the game! You are awesome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-10-24T14:30:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6212245217911824119","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-6350729003495580096","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"update","title":"itch.io Demo Update","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45023431/387169fc93d1c3ec5c786b4076024f9573a42da3.png We’re rolling out the first update to our Dawn of Defense demo on Itch.io! This update includes improvements such as visual and sound indicators for enemy invasions, reworked enemy paths, and tooltips for various game elements. Check it out: Dawn of Defense Demo We've also revamped the start screen tutorial and made adjustments to the main menu and game visuals. Check the detailed changelog below for all the changes! Change","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-10-03T22:16:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6350729003495580096","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-6242640076593579323","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"itch.io Demo Release","summary":"Check out our first demo on itch.io: Play Now {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45023431/9b55a70549fa830db55e2373f9497d83420649b1.png Dawn of Defense is not quite ready for a Steam demo yet, but we want to gather early feedback and share our progress. We hope you have fun playing and let us know what you think!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-09-04T16:29:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6242640076593579323","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-6240387642451007307","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Our First Gamescom as Indie-Devs","summary":"It was a really cool experience to see people playing our game, and a big 'thank you' to everyone who stopped by our booth!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-28T15:17:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6240387642451007307","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-5875595438704018868","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for 5.000 Wishlists","summary":"Since we started taking Dawn of Defense to the public we have seen ever growing support for our game. Now we are already sitting at 5.000 wishlists. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45023431/1d380230d29905160f9308442524b4e6912858d1.png Your support keeps us going! Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-26T21:26:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5875595438704018868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2781660-5963414363405077526","game_id":"steam-2781660","kind":"announcement","title":"We Passed 1.000 Wishlists","summary":"10 days after releasing the annoucement trailer for 'Dawn of Defense', you already gave us over 1.000 wishlists! We still have a long way to go, but we are very grateful and it gave us a huge motivational boost! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45023431/b9eb57fc17e4ae5ff6e963d05facf439fbbf7959.png Thanks y'all for your support!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-12T13:21:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5963414363405077526","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-